[300.978169, "o", "ton scratch=False block=16384 warps=16: mean=441.4us min=439.6 max=442.4 maxdiff=3.46e-06\r\n[Profiling] Using device: 0 NVIDIA H100 80GB HBM3, warm up 3, trials 20\r\ntriton scratch=False block=16384 warps=32: mean=440.6us min=439.3 max=442.2 maxdiff=3.46e-06\r\n[Profiling] Using device: 0 NVIDIA H100 80GB HBM3, warm up 3, trials 20\r\ntriton scratch=False block=32768 warps=32: mean=443.8us min=442.7 max=445.5 maxdiff=3.10e-06\r\n[Profiling] Using device: 0 NVIDIA H100 80GB HBM3, warm up 3, trials 20\r\ngraph scratch=True: mean=618.7us min=617.2 max=620.4 maxdiff=3.70e-06\r\n[Profiling] Using device: 0 NVIDIA H100 80GB HBM3, warm up 3, trials 20\r\ngraph scratch=False: mean=441.4us min=439.9 max=452.1 maxdiff=3.46e-06\r\n"]
